  "description": {
    "text": "The Black Kyurem-EX deck of the second Battle Strength Deck 60 pair, two ready-built 60-card decks released together on 19 October 2012, a year after the Reshiram-EX and Zekrom-EX decks. Each is led by its own Kyurem-EX, a different card from those of the Freeze Bolt and Cold Flare expansions, and also holds a Team Plasma Pokémon-EX, here Zapdos-EX, with strong Trainer cards such as Professor Juniper, Pokémon Catcher and Ultra Ball. A playmat, a coin, damage counters and markers and a strategy guide for its Kyurem came with it.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ポケモンカードゲームBW　バトル強化デッキ60「ブラックキュレムEX」「ホワイトキュレムEX」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20120923001158/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/bkwk.html"
      },
      {
